    "title": "销售预定操作教程",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202402/c11db15033772d786da07b02a9724393.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video>\n新增销售预定订单  <strong>————————————————————</strong></p>\n<p><strong>新增销售预定订单路径</strong>：【销售】-【销售预定】-【新增销售预定】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202402/21f84f8ea6cc988e38b1c8548623b79f.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>业务场景</strong>：销售预订货品，以便仓库备货出库，一般用于与客户达成协议的合同记录，货品并不实际出库。</p>\n<p><strong>功能说明</strong>：</p>\n<p>1、新增销售预定订单时，客户和货品是必须填入的。</p>\n<p>2、支持预付定金。</p>\n<p>查看销售预定订单  <strong>————————————————————</strong></p>\n<p><strong>查看销售预定订单路径</strong>：【销售】-【销售订单-列表】</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202105/e0a1bce2de93ea7267ed6a2d4366867f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>业务场景</strong>：满足老板查找已开出【销售订单】的需求，方便业务处理。</p>\n",
